      "instance_name": "royal_family",
      "label": "British Royal Family",
      "description": "The meme implies a context of Meghan Markle's status as a member of the British Royal Family. The phrase 'the fresh prince' is used to suggest she is an outsider or not truly belonging, which is a derogatory stereotype that undermines her legitimacy and dignity as a royal. This requires background knowledge of her role and status within the royal family to understand the implied criticism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
