      "instance_name": "derogatory_stereotype",
      "label": "Derogatory Stereotype of Outsiders",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that outsiders or newcomers are not truly belonging or are unwelcome. This is a common trope in social commentary and media, often used to belittle or dismiss individuals perceived as 'new' or 'different.' In this case, it is applied to Meghan Markle, implying she is not a true or legitimate member of the royal family, which is a harmful and demeaning stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
