      "label": "mocking and contemptuous emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is mocking contempt, conveyed through the use of the text overlay 'the fresh prince' which is a derogatory reference to the TV show 'The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air'. This phrase is used to belittle Meghan Markle by implying she is an outsider or not truly belonging in the royal family, which is a demeaning and condescending stereotype. The emotional tone is one of disdain and ridicule, targeting her perceived legitimacy and status.",
